{"ex-210-1":{"id":"ex-210-1","chapter":"210","number":1,"title":"作用於物體的引力","question":"<p>兩個球對稱物體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 置於地球表面，兩者的中心點相距 2 m。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的質量分別為 7 kg 和 5 kg。已知：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6.67 × 10<sup>–11</sup> N m<sup>2</sup> kg<sup>–2</sup></p><p>(a) 估算 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 作用於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的引力的量值。</p><p>(b) 估算地球作用於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的引力。地球的質量是 5.97 × 10<sup>24</sup> kg，半徑是6370 km。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/eb5581a0aec2e00dc15babf6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:250.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 引力 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{GMm}{r^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.67</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(6.67 \\times  10^{-11}) \\times  7 \\times  5}{2^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 5.84 × 10<sup>–10</sup> N</p><p>(b) 由於只須估算結果，取 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的重心和地球中心點的距離為 6370 km。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{GMm}{r^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.67</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5.97</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>24</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6370</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(6.67 \\times  10^{-11}) \\times  5 \\times  (5.97 \\times  10^{24})}{(6370 \\times  10^{3})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 49.1 N</p><p>地球作用於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的引力是 49.1 N（指向地球中心）。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>r 取為兩者中心之間的距離。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_210_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3f969b995c8389b114dcc679f5c5728ed5fdcc4ac73b21f10ee0e33adcefb205","segments":[{"page":4,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.333983398437454,560.2833009033203,301.4802703857422],"text":"例 題 1 作用於物體的引力\r\n兩個球對稱物體 A 和 B 置於地球表面，兩者的中心點相距 2 m。A 和\r\nB 的質量分別為 7 kg 和 5 kg。已知：G = 6.67 × 10–11 N m2\r\n kg–2\r\nA B\r\n2 m\r\n(a) 估算 A 作用於 B 的引力的量值。\r\n(b) 估算地球作用於 B 的引力。地球的質量是 5.97 × 1024 kg，半徑是\r\n6370 km。\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,301.4802703857422,560.2833009033203,475.5879833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 引力 = GMm\r\nr\r\n2 = (6.67 × 10–11) × 7 × 5\r\n22 = 5.84 × 10–10 N\r\n(b) 由於只須估算結果，取 B 的重心和地球中心點的距離為6370 km。\r\nF = GMm\r\nr\r\n2 = (6.67 × 10–11) × 5 × (5.97 × 1024)\r\n(6370 × 103\r\n)\r\n2 = 49.1 N \r\n地球作用於 B 的引力是 49.1 N（指向地球中心）。\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.333983398437454,179.2833009033203,475.5879833984375],"text":"B 的重心離地面的高度相對\r\n地球的半徑小得多。\r\nB\r\nc.g.\r\n潮汐\r\n潮汐是海平面的漲落現\r\n象，由引力導致。你知\r\n道潮汐怎樣形成嗎？\r\np.450\r\n知多一點\r\n提提你\r\n取 r 為兩個中心點的距離。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-210-2":{"id":"ex-210-2","chapter":"210","number":2,"title":"引力、質量和距離","question":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 兩個粒子相距 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>，它們之間的引力是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span>。已知 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的質量是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>在以下情況，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 會怎樣改變？</p><p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> 增至原本的兩倍。</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 增至原本的兩倍。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 由於 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> ∝ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 2</p><p>⇒ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = 2<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math></p><p>如果 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 加倍，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 也會加倍。</p><p>(b) 由於 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> ∝ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>)<sup>2</sup> = (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>)<sup>2</sup> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p>⇒ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math></p><p>如果 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 加倍，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 會變為原來的 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_210_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3f969b995c8389b114dcc679f5c5728ed5fdcc4ac73b21f10ee0e33adcefb205","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,207.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 2 引力、質量和距離\r\nX 和 Y 兩個粒子相距 r，它們之間的引力是 F。已知 X 的質量是 m。\r\n在以下情況，F 會怎樣改變？\r\n(a) m 增至原本的兩倍。\r\n(b) r 增至原本的兩倍。\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,207.6500701904297,560.2833009033203,513.8339833984376],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 由於 F ∝ m，\r\nF1\r\nF0\r\n = m1\r\nm0\r\n = 2\r\n⇒ F1 = 2F0\r\n如果 m 增至原本的兩倍，F 也會增至原本的兩倍。\r\n(b) 由於 F ∝ 1\r\nr\r\n2，\r\nF1\r\nF0\r\n = \r\n1\r\nr1\r\n2\r\n1\r\nr0\r\n2\r\n = • r0\r\nr1\r\n•2\r\n = •1\r\n2\r\n•2\r\n = 1\r\n4\r\n⇒ F1 = 1\r\n4\r\nF0\r\n如果 r 增至原本的兩倍，F 會變成原本的 1\r\n4\r\n。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-210-3":{"id":"ex-210-3","chapter":"210","number":3,"title":"在月球上的重量","question":"<p>玉兔號是中國首輛在月球上運作的探測車，質量是 140 kg。</p><p>已知：月球質量 = 7.35 × 10<sup>22</sup> kg，月球半徑 = 1.74 × 10<sup>6</sup> m</p><p>假設地球和太陽的效應可以略去不計，求以下物理量在月球表面的值：</p><p>(a) 重力加速度；</p><p>(b) 玉兔號的重量。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/38d7f71423a8fa4ecb00a27b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:295.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 重力加速度 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{GM}{r^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.67</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7.35</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>22</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.74</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(6.67 \\times  10^{-11}) \\times  (7.35 \\times  10^{22})}{(1.74 \\times  10^{6})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.62 m s<sup>–2</sup></p><p>(b) 重量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 140 × 1.62 = 227 N</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_210_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3f969b995c8389b114dcc679f5c5728ed5fdcc4ac73b21f10ee0e33adcefb205","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[49.83430090332031,443.3509833984375,560.2833009033203,648.6670684814453],"text":"例 題 3 在月球上的重量\r\n玉兔號是中國首輛在月球上運作的探測車，質量是 140 kg。\r\n已知：月球質量 = 7.35 × 1022 kg，\r\n月球半徑 = 1.74 × 106\r\n m\r\n假設地球和太陽的效應可以略去不計，求以下物理量在月球\r\n表面的值：\r\n(a) 重力加速度；\r\n(b) 玉兔號的重量。\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[49.83430090332031,648.6670684814453,560.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 重力加速度 g = GM\r\nr\r\n2 = (6.67 × 10–11) × (7.35 × 1022)\r\n(1.74 × 106\r\n)\r\n2 = 1.62 m s–2\r\n(b) 重量 = mg = 140 × 1.62 = 227 N\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-210-4":{"id":"ex-210-4","chapter":"210","number":4,"title":"太空人的重量","question":"<p>富柏是一名太空人，質量為 60 kg。已知地球半徑是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，假設月球和太陽的效應可略去不計。判斷富柏在以下各位置時的重量：</p><p>(a) 在地球表面；</p><p>(b) 執行太空任務期間，在距離地球表面 2<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的高度。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 重量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 60 × 9.81 = 589 N</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{g}{g_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\frac{GM_{E}}{r^{2}}}{\\frac{GM_{E}}{R_{E}^{2}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{R_{E}^{2}}{r^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{R_{E}^{2}}{(3R_{E})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 9.81 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.09 m s<sup>–2</sup></p><p>重量 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 60 × 1.09 = 65.4 N</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>「在地球表面以上 2R<sub>E</sub> 處」即「距離地心 3R<sub>E</sub> 處」。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_210_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3f969b995c8389b114dcc679f5c5728ed5fdcc4ac73b21f10ee0e33adcefb205","segments":[{"page":10,"kind":"question","box":[183.4833009033203,56.20098339843753,560.4833009033202,198.51744079589844],"text":"例 題 4 太空人的重量\r\n富柏是一名太空人，質量為 60 kg。已知地球半徑是 RE，假設月球和\r\n太陽的效應可略去不計。判斷富柏在以下各位置時的重量：\r\n(a) 在地球表面；\r\n(b) 執行太空任務期間，在距離地球表面 2RE 的高度。\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"answer","box":[183.4833009033203,198.51744079589844,560.4833009033202,382.0539833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 重量 = mg0 = 60 × 9.81 = 589 N\r\n(b) g\r\ng0\r\n = \r\nGME\r\nr\r\n2\r\nGME\r\nRE\r\n2\r\n = RE\r\n2\r\nr\r\n2 = RE\r\n2\r\n(3RE)\r\n2 = 1\r\n9\r\n⇒ g = 9.81 ×\r\n1\r\n9 = 1.09 m s–2\r\n重量 = mg = 60 × 1.09 = 65.4 N\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.20098339843753,179.4833009033203,382.0539833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n距離地球表面2RE 的高度，\r\n即是與地球中心的距離為\r\n3RE。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-210-5":{"id":"ex-210-5","chapter":"210","number":5,"title":"太陽引力的效應","question":"<p>太陽的質量約為地球的 3.33 × 10<sup>5</sup> 倍。估算在地球表面由太陽引致的重力加速度。已知：地球半徑 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6.37 × 10<sup>6</sup> m，地球與太陽的距離 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.50 × 10<sup>11</sup> m</p>","answer":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{g}{g_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\frac{GM_{S}}{D_{S}^{2}}}{\\frac{GM_{E}}{R_{E}^{2}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{M_{S}}{M_{E}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ) (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>D</mi><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{R_{E}^{2}}{D_{S}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> )</p><p>= (3.33 × 10<sup>5</sup>) × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.37</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.50</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(6.37 \\times  10^{6})^{2}}{(1.50 \\times  10^{11})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 6.005 × 10<sup>–4</sup></p><p>⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 9.81 × (6.005 × 10<sup>–4</sup>) = 0.005 89 m s<sup>–2</sup> 在地球表面，由太陽引致的重力加速度是 0.005 89 m s<sup>–2</sup>。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_210_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3f969b995c8389b114dcc679f5c5728ed5fdcc4ac73b21f10ee0e33adcefb205","segments":[{"page":10,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,401.3509833984375,560.2833009033203,515.6670684814453],"text":"例 題 5 太陽引力的效應\r\n太陽的質量約為地球的 3.33 × 105 倍。估算在地球表面由太陽引致的\r\n重力加速度。已知：地球半徑 RE = 6.37 × 106\r\n m，地球與太陽的距\r\n離 DS = 1.50 × 1011 m\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,515.6670684814453,560.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"題 解\r\ng\r\ng0\r\n = \r\nGMS\r\nDS\r\n2\r\nGME\r\nRE\r\n2\r\n = • MS\r\nME\r\n• • RE\r\n2\r\nDS\r\n2\r\n•\r\n = (3.33 × 105\r\n) × (6.37 × 106\r\n)\r\n2\r\n(1.50 × 1011)\r\n2\r\n = 6.005 × 10–4\r\n⇒ g = 9.81 × (6.005 × 10–4) = 0.005 89 m s–2\r\n在地球表面，由太陽引致的重力加速度是 0.005 89 m s–2。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-210-6":{"id":"ex-210-6","chapter":"210","number":6,"title":"地球上空的引力場強度","question":"<p>(a) 證明在地球表面，地球引力場強度 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的量值是 9.81 N kg<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>已知：</p><p>地球質量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 5.97 × 10<sup>24</sup> kg，地球半徑 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6.37 × 10<sup>6</sup> m</p><p>(b) 質量為 4500 kg 的人造衞星位於地球表面以上 3<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的高度。</p><p>(i) 在人造衞星的位置，地球引力場強度的量值是多少？</p><p>(ii) 求地球作用於人造衞星的引力的量值。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{GM_{E}}{R_{E}^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.67</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5.97</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>24</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.37</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(6.67 \\times  10^{-11}) \\times  (5.97 \\times  10^{24})}{(6.37 \\times  10^{6})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 9.81 N kg<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(b) (i) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{g}{g_{0}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\frac{GM_{E}}{r^{2}}}{\\frac{GM_{E}}{R_{E}^{2}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{R_{E}^{2}}{r^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{R_{E}^{2}}{(4R_{E})^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{16}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 9.81 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{16}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.613 N kg<sup>–1</sup></p><p>引力場強度的量值是 0.613 N kg<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(ii) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4500 × 0.613 = 2760 N 引力的量值是 2760 N。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_210_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3f969b995c8389b114dcc679f5c5728ed5fdcc4ac73b21f10ee0e33adcefb205","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[188.28297420332035,526.6600795984375,565.2829742033204,749.1190795984375],"text":"例 題 6 地球上空的引力場強度\r\n(a) 證明在地球表面，地球引力場強度 g0 的量值是 9.81 N kg–1。\r\n已知：\r\n地球質量 ME = 5.97 × 1024 kg，\r\n地球半徑 RE = 6.37 × 106\r\n m\r\n(b) 質量為 4500 kg 的人造衞星位於地球表面以上 3RE 的高度。\r\n (i) 在人造衞星的位置，地球引力場強度的量值是多少？\r\n (ii) 求地球作用於人造衞星的引力的量值。\r\n"},{"page":14,"kind":"answer","box":[183.28300480332032,67.91007995605469,560.2830048033203,320.9471063984374],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) g0 = GME\r\nRE\r\n2 = (6.67 × 10–11) × (5.97 × 1024)\r\n(6.37 × 106\r\n)\r\n2 = 9.81 N kg–1\r\n(b) (i) g\r\ng0\r\n = \r\nGME\r\nr 2\r\nGME\r\nRE\r\n2\r\n = RE\r\n2\r\nr 2 = RE\r\n2\r\n(4RE)\r\n2 = 1\r\n16\r\n ⇒ g = 9.81 ×\r\n1\r\n16 = 0.613 N kg–1\r\n 引力場強度的量值是 0.613 N kg–1。\r\n (ii) F = mg = 4500 × 0.613 = 2760 N\r\n 引力的量值是 2760 N。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-210-7":{"id":"ex-210-7","chapter":"210","number":7,"title":"太空站的軌道速率","question":"<p>天宮太空站的核心艙在地球表面上空約 400 km 的高度，沿圓形軌道圍繞地球勻速運行。地球的質量和半徑分別是 5.97 × 10<sup>24</sup> kg 和6370 km。估算太空站的</p><p>(a) 軌道速率；</p><p>(b) 軌道週期（答案以分鐘表示）。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = (6370 + 400) × 10<sup>3</sup> = 6.77 × 10<sup>6</sup> m</p><p>由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>G</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>M</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>G</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>M</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m s</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math></p><p>太空站的軌道速率為 7670 m s<sup>−1</sup>。</p><p>(b) 軌道周期 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 5546 s = 92.4 min</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_210_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3f969b995c8389b114dcc679f5c5728ed5fdcc4ac73b21f10ee0e33adcefb205","segments":[{"page":20,"kind":"question","box":[183.3833009033203,386.11898339843754,560.3833009033203,541.4350433349609],"text":"例 題 7 太空站的軌道速率\r\n天宮太空站的核心艙在地球表面上空約 400 km 的高度，沿圓形軌\r\n道圍繞地球勻速運行。地球的質量和半徑分別是 5.97 × 1024 kg 和\r\n6370 km。估算太空站的\r\n(a) 軌道速率；\r\n(b) 軌道週期（答案以分鐘表示）。\r\n"},{"page":20,"kind":"answer","box":[183.3833009033203,541.4350433349609,560.3833009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) r = (6370 + 400) × 103\r\n = 6.77 × 106\r\n m\r\n根據 GMm\r\nr 2 = mv2\r\nr ，\r\nv = •  \r\nGM\r\nr = •  \r\n(6.67 × 10–11)(5.97 × 1024)\r\n6.77 × 106 = 7670 m s–1\r\n太空站的軌道速率是 7670 m s–1。\r\n(b) 軌道週期 = 2πr\r\nv = 2π × (6.77 × 106\r\n)\r\n7670\r\n = 5546 s = 92.4 分鐘\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-210-8":{"id":"ex-210-8","chapter":"210","number":8,"title":"地球靜止軌道","question":"<p>(a) 考慮地球表面的引力場強度，證明 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GM_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 3.98 × 10<sup>14</sup> N m<sup>2</sup> kg<sup>–1</sup>，其中 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是地球的質量。</p><p>已知：地球半徑 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{E}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6.37 × 10<sup>6</sup> m</p><p>(b) 一顆人造衞星在地球靜止軌道上圍繞地球自由移動，它看起來好像靜止在赤道上某地方的上空。</p><p>(i) 該人造衞星的週期是多少？</p><p>(ii) 求地球靜止軌道的半徑。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 地球表面的重力場強度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>G</mtext></mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>M</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtex