</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>地球同步軌道的半徑為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_210_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3f969b995c8389b114dcc679f5c5728ed5fdcc4ac73b21f10ee0e33adcefb205","segments":[{"page":23,"kind":"question","box":[188.4833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.4833009033202,270.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 8 地球靜止軌道\r\n(a) 考慮地球表面的引力場強度，證明 GME = 3.98 × 1014 N m2\r\n kg–1，\r\n其中 ME 是地球的質量。\r\n已知：地球半徑 RE = 6.37 × 106\r\n m\r\n(b) 一顆人造衞星在地球靜止軌道上圍繞地球自由移動，它看起來好\r\n像靜止在赤道上某地方的上空。\r\n (i) 該人造衞星的週期是多少？\r\n (ii) 求地球靜止軌道的半徑。\r\n"},{"page":23,"kind":"answer","box":[188.4833009033203,270.6500701904297,565.4833009033202,533.1869833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 地球表面的引力場強度 = GME\r\nRE\r\n2 = 9.81 N kg–1\r\nGME = 9.81 × RE\r\n2\r\n = 9.81 × (6.37 × 106\r\n)\r\n2\r\n = 3.98 × 1014 N m2\r\n kg–1\r\n(b) (i) 24 小時\r\n (ii) ω = 2π\r\nT = 2π\r\n24 × 60 × 60\r\n = 7.27 × 10–5 rad s–1\r\n 根據 GMm\r\nr 2 = mrω2\r\n，\r\n r = \r\n3\r\n•  \r\nGM\r\nω2 = \r\n3\r\n•  \r\n3.98 × 1014\r\n(7.27 × 10–5)\r\n2 = 4.22 × 107\r\n m\r\n 地球靜止軌道的半徑是 4.22 × 107\r\n m。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}